    <strong>都市を対象とした大規模移動履歴に基づく疑似人流データ生成手法.</strong><br />
    Multimedia, Distributed, Cooperative, and Mobile Symposium (DICOMO2021), 2021.07. <strong>Best Paper Award & Outstanding Presentation Award</strong>
